      "text": "Aqui está o script Python completo que atende a todos os seus requisitos. \n\nEle possui um sistema que verifica se a biblioteca necessária (`pydub`) está instalada e, caso não esteja, **ele a instala automaticamente**. Além disso, a Zona de Configuração está bem destacada no topo.\n\n### ⚠️ Aviso Importante antes de rodar (Sobre aceitar todos os formatos)\nPara que o Python consiga ler e converter **todos os formatos de áudio** (mp3, m4a, ogg, flac, etc.), a biblioteca usa um motor externo chamado **FFmpeg**. \nO Python não consegue instalar o FFmpeg sozinho porque ele é um programa do sistema operacional, não uma biblioteca do Python. \n*   **Se você usa Windows:** Baixe o `ffmpeg`, extraia e coloque o arquivo `ffmpeg.exe` na mesma pasta deste script Python (ou adicione-o ao PATH do Windows).\n*   **Se você usa Mac/Linux:** Geralmente basta rodar `brew install ffmpeg` (Mac) ou `sudo apt install ffmpeg` (Linux) no terminal.\n\n---\n\n### O Script Python\n\nCrie um arquivo chamado `cortador_audio.py` e cole o código abaixo:\n\n```python\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport subprocess\n\n# \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n# FUNÇÃO DE INSTALAÇÃO AUTOMÁTICA DE BIBLIOTECAS\n# \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\ndef instalar_dependencias():\n    try:\n        import pydub\n    except ImportError:\n        print(\"Biblioteca \u0027pydub\u0027 não encontrada. Instalando automaticamente...\")\n        subprocess.check_call([sys.executable, \"-m\", \"pip\", \"install\", \"pydub\"])\n        print(\"Instalação concluída com sucesso!\\n\")\n\ninstalar_dependencias()\nfrom pydub import AudioSegment\n\n# \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n# ⚙️ ZONA DE CONFIGURAÇÃO\n# \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n\n# 1. Pasta onde o arquivo original está localizado\nPASTA_ORIGEM \u003d \"pasta_entrada\"\n\n# 2. Nome do arquivo de áudio (com a extensão)\nNOME_ARQUIVO_ORIGEM \u003d \"meu_audio.mp3\"\n\n# 3. Pasta onde os áudios cortados serão salvos\nPASTA_DESTINO \u003d \"pasta_saida\"\n\n# 4. Em quantas partes IGUAIS o áudio deve ser cortado?\nNUMERO_DE_PARTES \u003d 5\n\n# 5. Formato de saída desejado para os áudios cortados (ex: \u0027mp3\u0027, \u0027wav\u0027, \u0027ogg\u0027, \u0027flac\u0027)\nFORMATO_SAIDA \u003d \"mp3\"\n\n# \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n# 🚀 CÓDIGO PRINCIPAL (Não precisa alterar nada daqui para baixo)\n# \u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\u003d\n\ndef cortar_audio():\n    caminho_completo_origem \u003d os.path.join(PASTA_ORIGEM, NOME_ARQUIVO_ORIGEM)\n    \n    # Verifica se o arquivo existe\n    if not os.path.exists(caminho_completo_origem):\n        print(f\"ERRO: O arquivo \u0027{caminho_completo_origem}\u0027 não foi encontrado.\")\n        print(\"Verifique se a pasta e o nome do arquivo na Zona de Configuração estão corretos.\")\n        return\n\n    # Cria a pasta de destino se ela não existir\n    if not os.path.exists(PASTA_DESTINO):\n        os.makedirs(PASTA_DESTINO)\n        print(f\"Pasta de destino \u0027{PASTA_DESTINO}\u0027 criada.\")\n\n    print(f\"Carregando o áudio: {NOME_ARQUIVO_ORIGEM} (Isso pode levar alguns segundos...)\")\n    \n    try:\n        # from_file aceita qualquer formato (desde que o ffmpeg esteja no sistema)\n        audio \u003d AudioSegment.from_file(caminho_completo_origem)\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"ERRO ao carregar o áudio: {e}\")\n        print(\"DICA: Se for um erro de \u0027ffprobe\u0027 ou \u0027ffmpeg\u0027, certifique-se de que o FFmpeg está instalado no seu sistema.\")\n        return\n\n    duracao_total_ms \u003d len(audio)\n    tamanho_do_corte_ms \u003d duracao_total_ms // NUMERO_DE_PARTES\n    \n    nome_base \u003d os.path.splitext(NOME_ARQUIVO_ORIGEM)[0]\n\n    print(f\"\\nIniciando o corte em {NUMERO_DE_PARTES} partes iguais...\")\n    \n    for i in range(NUMERO_DE_PARTES):\n        tempo_inicio \u003d i * tamanho_do_corte_ms\n        \n        # Garante que a última parte pegue até o exato final do áudio, \n        # evitando perda de milissegundos devido a arredondamentos\n        if i \u003d\u003d NUMERO_DE_PARTES - 1:\n            tempo_fim \u003d duracao_total_ms\n        else:\n            tempo_fim \u003d (i + 1) * tamanho_do_corte_ms\n\n        # Corta o pedaço do áudio\n        pedaco_audio \u003d audio[tempo_inicio:tempo_fim]\n        \n        # Define o nome do arquivo de saída (Ex: meu_audio_parte_1_de_5.mp3)\n        nome_arquivo_saida \u003d f\"{nome_base}_parte_{i+1}_de_{NUMERO_DE_PARTES}.{FORMATO_SAIDA}\"\n        caminho_saida \u003d os.path.join(PASTA_DESTINO, nome_arquivo_saida)\n        \n        print(f\"Exportando: {nome_arquivo_saida}...\")\n        \n        # Exporta o arquivo no formato escolhido\n        pedaco_audio.export(caminho_saida, format\u003dFORMATO_SAIDA)\n\n    print(\"\\n✅ Processo concluído com sucesso!\")\n    print(f\"Os áudios foram salvos na pasta: \u0027{os.path.abspath(PASTA_DESTINO)}\u0027\")\n\nif __name__ \u003d\u003d \"__main__\":\n    cortar_audio()\n```\n\n### Como usar:\n1. Abra o código e vá na **⚙️ ZONA DE CONFIGURAÇÃO**.\n2. Altere o nome da `PASTA_ORIGEM` e crie essa pasta no mesmo local do script (ou coloque o caminho completo do seu computador, tipo `C:/Users/Nome/Musicas`).\n3. Coloque o nome correto do arquivo em `NOME_ARQUIVO_ORIGEM`.\n4. Defina o número de partes e o formato de saída.\n5. Salve e execute o script. \n\n### O que ele vai fazer:\n* Se for a primeira vez, ele vai abrir o terminal interno e instalar o `pydub`.\n* Ele vai ler o áudio e dividir exatamente pelo número que você pediu.\n* Ele vai salvar na pasta de destino com nomes bem claros, por exemplo:\n  * `meu_audio_parte_1_de_5.mp3`\n  * `meu_audio_parte_2_de_5.mp3`\n  * etc.",
